@host = http://localhost:5080

### Create a durable upload session
POST {{host}}/uploads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "sample.mp4",
  "contentType": "video/mp4",
  "sizeBytes": 1048576,
  "profile": "web-standard-v1"
}

### On-premises: use the returned videoId and one-time token
PUT {{host}}/uploads/REPLACE_WITH_VIDEO_ID/content
X-Upload-Token: REPLACE_WITH_ONE_TIME_TOKEN
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./sample.mp4

### Poll status; no POST /transcodes is needed
GET {{host}}/transcodes/REPLACE_WITH_VIDEO_ID

### Fetch result after Completed
GET {{host}}/transcodes/REPLACE_WITH_VIDEO_ID/result
